  "description": "High school student Lee So-Hyeon is addicted to “Please Take Care of the Princess,” a romance simulation game aimed at female audiences. While playing the game even as she’s crossing the street, she gets hit by a truck. When she opens her eyes again, she finds herself… None other than in the room of Princess Tianiir from “Please Take Care of the Princess”!\n\n *“I’ve become the princess, my favorite character, who’s kind, good-hearted, and smart! I’m going to live like this for the rest of my life!”*\n\nBut wait a minute, why is everyone giving me such dirty looks? The princess I thought was the kind-hearted protagonist is actually a villainess with top-notch acting skills?! There’s no way I can live as a villainess. Lee So-Hyeon, now in the body of Tianiir, decides to completely transform her villainess image…\n\n(Source: Naver, translated)",
